    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14851d0a82ab5cefd3b70b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉……感觉很Nervous呢Death。\r\n早餐也只吃了五个Hamburger，\r\n就觉得吃不太下了……",
