    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3eb36a454d1f2a7d7600256d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Wow，天空好蓝！\r\n简直就像肯塔基州的天空！\r\n露营真是太开心了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5700abbfae38185e0e61767c3d80525a03cf6b1079d5159f6bb7cc8995122bfc",
